  "note": {
    "id": "16 hari libur nasional dan 11 hari cuti bersama sesuai SKB perubahan kedua. Memuat perubahan cuti Idulfitri serta tambahan cuti Iduladha 28 dan 30 Juni. Cuti bersama mengikuti ketentuan instansi atau perusahaan.",
    "en": "16 national holidays and 11 collective leave days from the second amended joint decree. Includes revised Eid al-Fitr leave and additional Eid al-Adha leave on 28 and 30 June. Collective leave follows employer or agency rules."
  }
